data: {"id": "696285c67b614548-thinking-parallel_evidence-2078", "run_id": "696285c67b614548", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "让我基于已有的工具结果进行综合分析。从已采集的证据来看：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 状态 (kubectl_get_yaml)\n- **Pod 状态矛盾**：phase=Running 但 deletionTimestamp=2026-09-14T09:02:54Z，deletionGracePeriodSeconds=3900 (65分钟)\n- **finalizers: none**（空）— 这是关键：没有 finalizer 阻止 Pod 删除\n- **nodeName**: node2，节点状态 **Ready**\n- **容器状态**：app container ready=true, restarts=0, exitCode=None\n- **容器命令**：Python 脚本注册 SIGTERM handler，打印 \"SIGTERM received; waiting\"，然后 **无限循环等待 `/state/teardown-requested` 文件存在**\n\n### 2. 事件 (kubectl_events)\n- `Stopping", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789372751283, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

